---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="YouTube Playback Speed Calculator" description="Calculate YouTube video watch time at any playback speed. Paste a YouTube URL to auto-detect duration, or enter it manually.">
  <section class="section-container" style="padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-lg); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-link);">YouTube</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-xl); color: var(--color-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-lg);">YouTube Playback Speed Calculator</h1>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">
      Calculate how long a YouTube video will take at any playback speed. Paste a YouTube URL to auto-detect the duration, or enter it manually.
    </p>

    <div style="background-color: var(--color-canvas-elevated); padding: var(--spacing-lg); border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">
      <label style="display: block; font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);">YouTube URL</label>
      <input type="url" id="yt-url" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..." style="width: 100%; padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md); border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-canvas); color: var(--color-ink); font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);" />
      <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm); color: var(--color-mute); margin: 0;">Supports youtube.com/watch, youtu.be, and youtube.com/shorts links. Public videos only.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">How It Works</h2>
    <ul style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); padding-left: var(--spacing-lg);">
      <li>Paste a public YouTube URL to auto-fill Hours, Minutes, and Seconds.</li>
      <li>Choose a playback speed from 0.25x to 4.0x.</li>
      <li>See the adjusted watch time and time saved instantly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Limitations</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Duration detection works for most public YouTube videos. It does not work for private, unlisted, age-restricted, or members-only videos. YouTube may also block automated detection on some videos. If detection fails, enter the duration manually.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Ready to calculate? Go to the <a href="/" style="color: var(--color-link);">Playback Speed Calculator</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
